laced on  her years ago and so with the mark  activated diana turns glowing white and  she's able to banish the upside down man  back to his dimension simply by uttering  a spell given to her by zatanna so  already this version of wonder woman has  the ability to open dimensional barriers  we then see another flashback of diana  as a child living on themyscira on the  day after diana's encounter with hecate  now diana's mother queen hippolyta  questions the priestess about what  happened and they basically explained  that it must have been some kind of a  dream or hallucination that diana had  experienced of course this comforts  diana enough that she's able to accept  their answer and essentially leave now  hippolyta continues to question the  servants and the goddess herself shows  up and then basically explains that  their worship had not been satisfactory  and that she'll soon return for the  witch mart and so fast forwarding to the  present day and wonder woman is  essentially with the justice league  petitioning them to approve the creation  of justice league dark in order to deal  with other worldly threats and simply  explains how powerful the upside down  man was and when superman questions how  she was able to defeat him diana which  was really interesting actually removed  her hand from the lasso of truth so she  could lie and simply say she just got  lucky now later hecate would reappear on  earth and reveal that she is the one  responsible for the disappears of  earth's magic and she reawakens diana's  memory of who she is and being branded  with her mark and so as wonder woman and  justice lee dark search for a solution  they seek out a sorceress named cersei  who explains that long ago before the  gods had walked the earth that hecate  had split her soul into five pieces and  divided it among five young women she  called her witch marked until such a  time that she was able to absorb all of  this back into herself now as they  discussed diana's power 