s  now still doing hecate spitting she  destroys a mountain simply by gesturing  and then also leaves every place of  worship in shambles except those  dedicated to the warship of hecate  herself now eventually diana begins to  realize that she cannot carry all this  power for much longer and begs the  goddess to release her and to use her  powers to heal magic instead of  destroying it the goddess of course  refuses to listen to diana and desperate  to defeat this chick diana asks zatanna  to use her magic to open the door  between their dimension and the  dimension where the upside down man  resides and although zatanna is  reluctant to do that she ultimately  agrees and the upside down man comes  through the door and immediately begins  devouring heke now as diana's power  begins to fade she opens a gateway back  to earth for the rest of the justice  league dark to go through and uses the  last bit of her power to close the  doorway to the upside down man's  dimension seemingly sealing him away  forever one thing i want to point out is  that this one storyline was the only  time when we saw wonder woman this  powerful so unfortunately we don't have  a lot of feats to talk about but the few  that we do have show just how insane  this version of wonder woman is she had  the powers of a literal goddess could  level mountains at will and could tear  holes in reality itself if she had been  allowed to keep serving this chick and  hadn't been separated from her control  or power the world as we know it in dc  comics literally would not exist but let  me know what you guys think right i mean  it's not our traditional beyond omega  level series but it's really more of  just kind of a character story arc  basically but let me know what you guys  think down in the comments section also  always keep me posted if there's anybody  in particular that you want to see thank  you all for watching and i will catch  you all later  peace
 

